    "parentId": "fb33c91a-c0c3-48d3-b400-c17014e325ac",
    "position": 41,
    "kind": "rich_text",
    "payload": {
      "html": "<p>The Saint Helen Pastoral Council is a broadly representative group of parish members and is presided over by the pastor. The Code of Canon Law indicates that the Pastoral Council is a consultative body established to help foster pastoral activity in a parish (Canon 536). The primary focus and work of the Pastoral Council is the spiritual growth and mission of the parish community.</p>\n<p><a href=\"/pastoral-council\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">View Pastoral Council</a></p>",
      "kind": "rich_text"
    },
